msgctxt "64"
msgid "Dammit... We're so screwed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Urgh... I told you this wasn't a good place to do business..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Meow... Meooow..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Did you hear that? That's a wildcat!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"The guy in the red shirt was trying to pick up the Iriomote wildcat from the"
" seller here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "He was!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "The real dealer's the guy in the cheap suit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"It all makes sense now... That's why the cage was empty when I checked the "
"man in red!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "You checked before the deal went down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Crap."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Anyway, looks like we got two birds with one stone this time. I'd say we "
"made out pretty good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much! It's enough that you solved this, but you even handled it"
" quietly!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Did you hand those thugs over to the cops?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"I did. The case is already solved, and the cops are willing to wait until "
"after closing hours to investigate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"The detective was pretty upset I didn't report the crime in the first place,"
" though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"But it sounds like everything turned out okay. And your reputation's still "
"fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "That's right! And it's all thanks to you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Thank you so much for all you've done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "You got <Color:8>50,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>50.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Now, thanks to your efforts, the market can run smoothly again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Take this with my gratitude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "You got <Color:8>30,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>30.000 yen<Color:Default>."

